id: pm-ts-starter-github-38a2e98e983e-204
title: Bun release gate hangs after its last test and CI jobs have no timeout (two runners held for 2+ hours)
description: "GH issue #204: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/issues/204 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-09T11:55:55Z · updated 2026-11-09T11:55:55Z"
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
